21	/****************************************************************************
22	 * Person Detection Demo for openvela/NuttX
23	 *
24	 * This application uses TFLite Micro to run a MobileNet V1 based person
25	 * detection model (INT8 quantized, 96x96 grayscale input).
26	 *
27	 * Usage:
28	 *   person_detection              - Run with a blank (zero) image
29	 *   person_detection -t <file>    - Run with test BMP image
30	 *   person_detection -r <N>      - Run N iterations for benchmarking
31	 ****************************************************************************/
